{
  "title": "Radiant Geometry",
  "about": "Golden sacred geometry that morphs from a tiled lattice of star rosettes to a single central mandala with spiral arms (after Radiant's Radiant Geometry by Paul Bakaus). The morph can swing over a cycle of beats or build through the song section, lattice in the groove and mandala by the drop.",
  "groups": [
